                /** @description Restrict the result to test results attached to these batches by ID (the batch's ID, as returned in each result's `batch_id`). A result is attached to exactly one package or one batch, so this matches only batch-attached results. This filter looks at direct attachment only: if a batch *inherits* a test result from its assembly inputs, that batch is not considered here — only batches the result is directly attached to are matched. Repeat the bracketed key once per ID. Unknown IDs match nothing; an empty list is treated as no filter. At most 200 IDs may be given. */
